---
/**
 * VeteranLifeReturn — "Getting better means getting life back."
 * Layout: text column, then 3-image strip below.
 * Mood shift: from treatment and obstacles → life returning.
 */
---

<section class="vlr" aria-labelledby="vlr-heading">
  <div class="vlr__inner">

    <h2 class="vlr__heading" id="vlr-heading">
      Getting better means getting life back.
    </h2>
    <p class="vlr__lead lead">
      Recovery is about more than hurting less.
    </p>

    <div class="vlr__groups">

      <div class="vlr__group">
        <h3 class="vlr__group-title">Getting back to</h3>
        <ul class="vlr__list" role="list">
          <li class="vlr__item">Work and training.</li>
          <li class="vlr__item">Yard work and everyday routines.</li>
          <li class="vlr__item">Time with family without sitting things out.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="vlr__group">
        <h3 class="vlr__group-title">And less of</h3>
        <ul class="vlr__list" role="list">
          <li class="vlr__item">Planning the day around pain.</li>
          <li class="vlr__item">Losing progress when treatment gets interrupted.</li>
          <li class="vlr__item">Having to rely on medication just to get through the day.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p class="vlr__closing">
      Returning to the parts of life an injury has slowly taken away.
    </p>

    <!-- 3-image strip — below all text content -->
    <div class="vlr__grid" aria-hidden="true">

      <!-- Large image — spans 2 rows -->
      <figure class="vlr__fig vlr__fig--large">
        <img
          src="/images/scullyblu_candid_unpolished_iPhone_photo_for_a_nonprofit_webs_d097577e0-7e15-4071-9d45-e80b1d7c13cf_3.png"
          alt="Older adult exercising with cable equipment"
          class="vlr__img"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>

      <!-- Small image 1 — exercise / movement -->
      <figure class="vlr__fig vlr__fig--small">
        <img
          src="/images/scullyblu_candid_unpolished_iPhone_photo_Black_man_in_his_for_e2393060-0bd4-4c5e-9354-3022882dbb8e_1.png"
          alt="Adult walking outdoors with a child"
          class="vlr__img"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>

      <!-- Small image 2 — garden / family / hobby -->
      <figure class="vlr__fig vlr__fig--small">
        <img
          src="/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_jytqlwjytqlwjytq.jpeg"
          alt="Adult and child spending time together with a basketball"
          class="vlr__img"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
